//! Vulkan compute shader lowering.
//!
//! This milestone lowers the typed Stockham IR into Vulkan GLSL 450, validates
//! that GLSL with the pure-Rust `naga` frontend, and can emit SPIR-V words with
//! the pure-Rust `naga` backend. Vulkan pipeline/device ownership remains separate
//! so code generation can be tested without a GPU or Vulkan SDK.

